[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15605.309, "timestamp": "04:20:05", "text": "まあ、待つことはできますよ。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15608.229, "timestamp": "04:20:08", "text": "敵の声が聞こえた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15609.55, "timestamp": "04:20:09", "text": "聞いた？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15612.469, "timestamp": "04:20:12", "text": "それ？彼は一度発砲した。彼らはそうすべきではなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15615.59, "timestamp": "04:20:15", "text": "諦めた。待って。とんでもない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15617.87, "timestamp": "04:20:17", "text": "ゲーム内でどこで会えますか？これは私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15621.07, "timestamp": "04:20:21", "text": "最初のストリームスナイパー"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15623.429, "timestamp": "04:20:23", "text": "経験。何てことだ。どこで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15626.07, "timestamp": "04:20:26", "text": "会う？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15629.269, "timestamp": "04:20:29", "text": "つまり、彼はそこにいるんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15641.469, "timestamp": "04:20:41", "text": "もしそれが彼ではなかったらどうなるだろうか。待って、それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15647.99, "timestamp": "04:20:47", "text": "あなた？待って、六、君なの？いや、違う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15649.83, "timestamp": "04:20:49", "text": "待って、"}]